This program includes pages of the CRG ScoreBoard, version 2027.1
(https://github.com/rollerderby/scoreboard), GPL-3, unchanged:

  server/web/views/overlay, views/wb, views/roster (the video overlay, the
  penalty whiteboard and the roster display), server/web/components/plt-input,
  components/roster-tab, json/core.js, json/WS.js, javascript/, styles/ and
  favicon.ico.

They run on the Java scoreboard's WebSocket protocol (package javaws).

Also from the CRG ScoreBoard 2027.1: the penalty code definitions
server/penalties/*.json (config/penalties), for the penalty codes' names.

